## SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

config PAYLOAD_UBOOT_SYNTACORE
	bool "U-Boot (Syntacore)"
	depends on SOC_SYNTACORE_COMMON
	help
	  Select this option to build the Syntacore U-Boot (3rdparty/u-boot
	  submodule, branch sc/2026.04) as the S-mode payload coreboot hands
	  over to OpenSBI. The Syntacore defconfig matching the platform is
	  used, with U-Boot linked at the entry address coreboot passes to
	  OpenSBI through the fw_dynamic info.

	  See Documentation/mainboard/syntacore/sc-qemu.md for the build and
	  run flows.
